==Icelandic==

===Verb===
'''kafa'''

# to [[dive]], to go so deep [[underwater]] that one can't be seen
#: ''[[hann#Icelandic|Hann]] '''kafaði''' 20 [[metri|metra]] [[undir]] [[yfirborð|yfirborðið]].''
#:: He '''dived''' 20 [[meter]]s [[under]] the [[surface]].

